---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Why 'agent' is doing too much work as a word — Greg O'Brien" current={2}>
<div data-screen-label="Note">
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--edge);margin-top:38px;padding:40px 56px 0">
<a href="/think" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">← All notes</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:34px 56px 44px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted)">Aug 2026</div>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:54px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:22ch">Why "agent" is doing too much work as a <span style="font-style:italic">word</span></h1>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch;color:var(--body)">Half the industry means "chatbot," the other half means something closer to software with judgment. That gap is the whole story.</p>
</div>
<div style="padding:40px 56px 24px"><div style="border:1px solid var(--edge)"><div data-shot="1" style="height:260px;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)">[ AGENT PHOTO ]</span></div></div></div>
<div style="padding:0 56px 44px;max-width:70ch">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">[Opening paragraph — placeholder. Plain, direct, no throat-clearing.]</p>
<p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">[Second paragraph — placeholder.]</p>
<div style="margin-top:34px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">[Section heading — placeholder]</div>
<p style="margin:9px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">[Placeholder paragraph.]</p>
<div style="margin-top:34px;font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;max-width:52ch">"[A pull quote — one sentence worth lifting out.]"</div>
<p style="margin:34px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">[Placeholder paragraph.]</p>
<div style="margin-top:26px;border:1px dashed var(--dash)"><div data-shot="1" style="height:190px;background:var(--stripe);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:20px"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.08em">[ OPTIONAL DIAGRAM ]</span></div></div>
<div style="margin-top:34px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600">[Closing heading — placeholder]</div>
<p style="margin:9px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--body)">[Closing paragraph — placeholder.]</p>
</div>
<div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding:40px 56px 14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline">
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)">Next note</span>
<a href="/think" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s ease" class="h-ink">All notes →</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:14px 56px 44px;max-width:70ch">
<a href="/think/why-agent-is-doing-too-much-work-as-a-word" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ruleSoft);text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);transition:color .2s ease" class="h-accent"><span style="font-family:Newsreader,serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3">[Note title — placeholder]</span><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap">Jul 2026</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</Layout>
